{"id":"log","name":"Log","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:log"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Log","text":"The smallest measure for liquids used by the Hebrews (Lev. 14:10, 12, 15, 21, 24), called in the Vulgate sextarius. It is the Hebrew unit of measure of capacity, and is equal to the contents of six ordinary hen’s eggs=the twelfth part of a him, or nearly a pint."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H3849","lemma":"לֹג","xlit":"lôg","gloss":"a log or measure forliquids","kjv":"log","count":4,"share":1},{"strong":"H8081","lemma":"שֶׁמֶן","xlit":"shemen","gloss":"grease, especially liquid","kjv":"anointing, fat, fruitful, oil","count":4,"share":1},{"strong":"H3532","lemma":"כֶּבֶשׂ","xlit":"kebes","gloss":"a ram","kjv":"lamb, sheep","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H8573","lemma":"תְּנוּפָה","xlit":"tᵉnûwphâh","gloss":"a brandishing","kjv":"offering, shaking, wave","count":2,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H5130","lemma":"נוּף","xlit":"nûwph","gloss":"to quiver","kjv":"lift up, move, offer, perfume","count":2,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H817","lemma":"אָשָׁם","xlit":"ʼâshâm","gloss":"guilt","kjv":"guiltiness, sin, trespass","count":2,"share":0.5}],"verses":["Lev.14.10","Lev.14.12","Lev.14.15","Lev.14.24"],"related":[{"id":"measure","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.034,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"anointing","type":"lexical","strong":"H8081","why":"both lead with שֶׁמֶן (H8081)"},{"id":"anointing-sacred","type":"lexical","strong":"H8081","why":"both lead with שֶׁמֶן (H8081)"},{"id":"extravagance","type":"lexical","strong":"H8081","why":"both lead with שֶׁמֶן (H8081)"},{"id":"frankincense","type":"lexical","strong":"H8081","why":"both lead with שֶׁמֶן (H8081)"},{"id":"meat-offerings","type":"lexical","strong":"H8081","why":"both lead with שֶׁמֶן (H8081)"},{"id":"oil","type":"lexical","strong":"H8081","why":"both lead with שֶׁמֶן (H8081)"}],"works":[]}
